WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.812 --> 00:00:22.498
"Gasser is a monster truck," Dipper said.

2
00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:32.339
"But he's really nice."

3
00:00:32.339 --> 00:00:36.725
"I'm Carlin," said an old van.

4
00:00:36.726 --> 00:00:39.838
"What do monster trucks do?"

5
00:00:39.838 --> 00:00:43.582
"I drive on dirt," Gasser said.

6
00:00:43.582 --> 00:00:47.605
"I also jump over stuff."

7
00:00:47.605 --> 00:00:51.573
"That sounds fun," Carlin said.

8
00:00:51.573 --> 00:00:55.925
"It sure does!" Grandma said.

9
00:00:55.926 --> 00:01:01.516
"Ha-ha, Grandma," Dipper said.

10
00:01:01.516 --> 00:01:09.966
"You don't jump over stuff."

11
00:01:09.967 --> 00:01:13.415
"Come on," Carlin said.

12
00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:17.123
"We'll show you kids around."

13
00:01:17.124 --> 00:01:29.624
Grandma and Carlin led the way.

14
00:01:29.625 --> 00:01:43.589
"The garden is so pretty," Poppy said.

15
00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:47.339
"Look," Grandma said.

16
00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:52.298
"Do you see our new pond?"

17
00:01:52.299 --> 00:01:56.124
"I see dirt!" Jeb said.

18
00:01:56.125 --> 00:01:59.310
"That's a big pile!" Eddy said.

19
00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:03.178
"Workers left it," Grandma said.

20
00:02:03.179 --> 00:02:09.509
"They dug out the pond.

21
00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:14.465
That's the dirt from the hole."

22
00:02:14.466 --> 00:02:18.988
"The dirt doesn't look nice," Carlin said.

23
00:02:18.989 --> 00:02:25.732
Suddenly—crunch!
